---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Ruben Lupi">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I'm Ruben, a software engineer. Software is my profession and a good part of what I think about, but it's
    not the whole of what I'm curious about.</p>
    <p>I also like reading about how people learn and how schools differ across Europe, about Montessori and Emmi
    Pikler. I like how bodies adapt to strength training, what the Greeks and Romans thought and built, the
    mathematics of reasoning under uncertainty, and how organisations end up producing the results they do.
    I don't see these as separate hobbies. They all come from wanting to understand how things work, and
    sometimes they overlap. Often they don't, and I'd rather not force it.</p>
    <p>I'm not an expert in most of this, and I don't need to be to enjoy studying it. I'd rather ask a good
    question than pretend to have the answer, and I'm as interested in ideas that fail, and in the
    contradictions and blind spots of a field, as in the ones that work.</p>
    <blockquote>Curiosity over expertise. Questions over certainty. Understanding over trends.</blockquote>
    <p>Here you'll find essays and notes, and a growing collection of critical reads of books. I'll get things
    wrong sometimes, and I'll say so when I find out.</p>
